AirPlay URL playback for tvOS 26 and later, applied to pyatv 0.18.0 by install.sh.

From https://github.com/postlund/pyatv/pull/2846 ("Fix compatibility with latest AirPlay", by
jlacivita; commit 8848ad3fd9ae46b8eb733bfc667b536a28f04c5a): its library files, without the debug
prints of every request and response. pyatv is MIT licensed (Copyright (c) 2020 Pierre Ståhl).
Without it tvOS accepts /play but never fetches the stream and answers /playback-info with 403.
Drop this file once a pyatv release includes the PR.

The PR also needs biplist, which install.sh installs.

